    <statement><p>Find an equation of the sphere with center (-4, 0, 2) and radius 5.</p>
<p><fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/> = 0</p>
<p>Note that you must move everything to the left hand side of the equation and 
that we desire the coefficients of the quadratic terms to be 1.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}+8x+0y+\left(-4\right)z+20-25</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
